{"timestamp":"2026-10-03T16:54:39.350Z","ordinal":67257,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0f77002cf3a055dd016ac1333a6c5087d2b047db45b6a08d98","status":"completed","call_id":"call_OR3xd2cuyodtkgw8utZkOKfg","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md\\n@@\\n   yet exposed as a UI logout operation: HTTP participant routes, resource and\\n   live channels, and foreground/background saves still need one consistently\\n   enforced credential transport before enabling the Original account action.\\n+  The resource-channel foundation now derives a separate HMAC capability\\n+  from the durable credential digest and exact session identity. A sandboxed\\n+  Player can eventually load relative resources without placing the general\\n+  participant bearer token in its URL. The resource capability cannot authorize\\n+  answer/Review/command requests, issue another capability or revoke access;\\n+  credential rotation, revocation and the participant's existing access deadline\\n+  also invalidate resource access. Unit and memory/file/SQLite regressions prove\\n+  this separation, cross-session rejection and validity across store restart.\\n+  HTTP resource URLs and Player resource-base responses are not wired yet;\\n+  these foundation tests do not claim an enforced HTTP resource boundary.\\n@@\\n-  per store), together with 138 unit and three frontend-state tests. PostgreSQL\\n-  validation of the new credential table remains its own pending CI gate;\\n-  the earlier PostgreSQL success does not establish this migration.\\n+  per store), together with 138 unit and three frontend-state tests at the\\n+  credential-table checkpoint. Its PostgreSQL integration and protected UI\\n+  jobs also passed in run 37135454646 for commit 6f78b267. That run nevertheless\\n+  failed its full/operational browser jobs at the workspace refresh checkbox;\\n+  it was not an all-green CI run. The later resource-capability extension has\\n+  its own pending PostgreSQL/CI gate.\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"tail -10 /tmp/testcenter-resource-capability-file.log\\ntail -10 /tmp/testcenter-resource-capability-sqlite.log\\ngit diff --check\\ngit diff --stat\\nrg -n 'ui_smoke_step=|diagnostic=|Error:|TimeoutError' /tmp/testcenter-workspace-checkbox-chromium-diagnostic.log | tail -5\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app\",\"login\":false,\"max_output_tokens\":1400}));\ntext(await tools.write_stdin({session_id:6976,chars:\"\",\"yield_time_ms\":1000,\"max_output_tokens\":500}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a10167-18c0-7481-a114-505958d1a634","create_time":1791046433.93225}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-03T16:54:39.365Z","ordinal":67258,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a","turn_id":"01a10167-18c0-7481-a114-505958d1a634","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-ffa6d4c0-4400-4d95-8a3e-c4c413dabd15","changes":{"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -79,2 +79,12 @@\n   enforced credential transport before enabling the Original account action.\n+  The resource-channel foundation now derives a separate HMAC capability\n+  from the durable credential digest and exact session identity. A sandboxed\n+  Player can eventually load relative resources without placing the general\n+  participant bearer token in its URL. The resource capability cannot authorize\n+  answer/Review/command requests, issue another capability or revoke access;\n+  credential rotation, revocation and the participant's existing access deadline\n+  also invalidate resource access. Unit and memory/file/SQLite regressions prove\n+  this separation, cross-session rejection and validity across store restart.\n+  HTTP resource URLs and Player resource-base responses are not wired yet;\n+  these foundation tests do not claim an enforced HTTP resource boundary.\n   As a prerequisite, the shipped background worker now retains its exact\n@@ -90,5 +100,8 @@\n   The complete API suite passed with memory, file and SQLite stores (160 tests\n-  per store), together with 138 unit and three frontend-state tests. PostgreSQL\n-  validation of the new credential table remains its own pending CI gate;\n-  the earlier PostgreSQL success does not establish this migration.\n+  per store), together with 138 unit and three frontend-state tests at the\n+  credential-table checkpoint. Its PostgreSQL integration and protected UI\n+  jobs also passed in run 37135454646 for commit 6f78b267. That run nevertheless\n+  failed its full/operational browser jobs at the workspace refresh checkbox;\n+  it was not an all-green CI run. The later resource-capability extension has\n+  its own pending PostgreSQL/CI gate.\n - Live-connection registration rejects unknown/duplicate tokens, tokens are\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1791046479364,"completed_at_ms":1791046479365}}
