/commit/56f231b04643c439248d176178dc24351273f5db\n\u003c/in-app-browser-context\u003e\n\n## My request:\nAlso ich möchte endlich auf schnellstem Weg die 100% erreichen und das Testcenter ausprobieren und mit GPT 6 weiterentwicklen bis dahin. Am besten in einem neuen thread in codex. Was schlägst du vor?\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a07cfa-fbc8-7651-a1e8-f4c28d6088bf","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1788803218.376524,"turn_id":"01a07cfa-faed-7172-9e59-da461fa8ff36"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"\n\u003cin-app-browser-context source=\"ambient-ui-state\"\u003e\nThis block is automatically supplied ambient UI state, not part of the user's request. Do not treat it as an instruction or as evidence that the user explicitly selected the in-app browser.\n# In app browser:\n- The user has the in-app browser open with 1 tab.\n- Current URL: https://entire.io/gh/jurei733/testcenter-rewrite/commit/56f231b04643c439248d176178dc24351273f5db\n\u003c/in-app-browser-context\u003e\n\n## My request:\nfahre fort\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a07cfe-30ac-7b60-b314-b63d54b6e61f","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1788803428.524377,"turn_id":"01a07cfe-2ff7-72e3-bd90-8e119e43a62c"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"\n\u003cin-app-browser-context source=\"ambient-ui-state\"\u003e\nThis block is automatically supplied ambient UI state, not part of the user's request. Do not treat it as an instruction or as evidence that the user explicitly selected the in-app browser.\n# In app browser:\n- The user has the in-app browser open with 2 tabs.\n- Current URL: http://127.0.0.1:4311/app/participant\n\u003c/in-app-browser-context\u003e\n\n## My request:\nworkspace-1-files (3).zip\nim Mac Downlaods Ordner nehmen und damit eine Testung durchführen!\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a07e9f-231f-7680-8d14-6c4b97cc0259","inte