e fort bis du die 100 % hast. Mache auch eine UI die identisch mit der original ui ist und optional verwendet werden kann\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a09404-6e21-7241-a363-3b3d1aaccf93","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1789189713.441391,"turn_id":"01a09404-6cf2-7891-8f7e-76aa774b437b"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f77002cf3a055dd016ac14d045eac87d296f4cca0ae1801de","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a10167-18c0-7481-a114-505958d1a634"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"content":[{"text":"Auch die bisher offene Wiederanmeldung nach einem echten HTTP-401 ist jetzt geprüft: Der Browser und der Hintergrund-Worker behalten Antwort und Übertragungs-ID; nach erneuter Anmeldung liefert der Worker die Antwort unverändert aus. Beim Quellenvergleich ist außerdem bestätigt: Die Original-Abmeldung hat einen Bestätigungsdialog. Den übernehme ich als nächsten UI-Schritt.\n","type":"output_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":89},"id":"msg_0f77002cf3a055dd016ac14d05bb7887d2a59220916ee1b228","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"create_time":1791053056.173302,"turn_id":"01a10167-18c0-7481-a114-505958d1a634"},"phase":"commentary","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f77002cf3a055dd016ac14d08ab5c87d2a6d3c38ec28a5ecb","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a10167-18c0-7481-a114-505958d1a634"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"call_id":"call_1LAIky0Y2F1qj3u29Upv1OUy","id":"ctc_0f77002cf3a055dd016ac14d26763487d28b61103fa25b89b9","input":"text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/ORIGINAL-UI-PARITY.md\\n@@\\n-this closes the logout interaction, not the complete visual-parity row.\\n+this verifies the server-backed logout path, not the complete visual-parity\\n+row. The pinned Original's confirmation dialog and audience-specific button\\n+order are the next account interaction to reproduce.\\n*** Update File: /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md\\n@@\\n   470kB error budget. Full integrated CI and equal-reference visual comparisons\\n   remain separate acceptance gates.\\n+  A separate headful browser check also passed an actual server 401 after a\\n+  second browser login rotated the first browser's key. Both foreground and\\n+  worker stores retained the exact response and delivery identity. Credential\\n+  re-entry restored the same run with a new key; with foreground saves blocked,\\n+  the actual worker delivered the byte-identical response and removed only\\n+  the delivered record. This is local browser evidence, not a new CI result.\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rg -n '^ui_smoke_step=' /tmp/testcenter-participant-logout-full-ui-gate.log | tail -n 5; tail -n 6 /tmp/testcenter-participant-logout-full-ui-gate.log; git diff --check; ps -p 49325 -o pid,command; git config --get core.hooksPath; ls -l ../.git/entire-sessions/01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a.json\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app\",\"max_output_tokens\":900,\"login\":false}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1791053056.173302,"turn_id":"01a10167-18c0-7481-a114-505958d1a634"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_1LAIky0Y2F1qj3u29Upv1OUy","guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000},"id":"ctco_01a10315-89aa-7db3-80e4-b917a7bb15f5","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1791053105.578846,"turn_id":"01a10167-18c0-7481-a114-505958d1a634"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{}","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"cd8be4\",\"wall_time_seconds