{"timestamp":"2026-10-03T19:33:22.555Z","ordinal":69255,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0f77002cf3a055dd016ac15868cacc87d29e424799e02310db","status":"completed","call_id":"call_nLTxeaiJiCitZN06e0j3LMJj","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md\\n@@\\n-An additional development-build run exposed `NG0100` in the Participant view\\n-while opening the official ABI Player family. It is an open rendering\\n-regression, not an accepted visual-parity state. Production-build browser\\n-verification is kept separate from this development-build finding.\\n+An additional development-build run exposed `NG0100` in the Participant view\\n+while opening the official ABI Player family. A fresh headful reproduction\\n+identified the synchronous Player `LOADING` log/save notification during\\n+`ngAfterViewInit`/input changes: it changed the parent's already-checked\\n+`canClearSession` binding. Logging and missing-input error notification now run\\n+in the existing cancellable frame callback before iframe loading, outside that\\n+render/verification pass. No Angular guard or global error reporting is disabled.\\n+The new `smoke:ui:verona-development` gate builds into an owned temporary\\n+directory and uses a fresh protected SQLite database. Its headful run passed\\n+both Rewrite and Original layouts, real official ABI text/choice input, durable\\n+save, authored reload, page reload and forward/back Unit changes, with the same\\n+run and byte-identical saved response, no page/console errors and final exit 0.\\n+It is registered as an independent CI matrix job. All 140 unit and 25 frontend\\n+state tests passed; the production frontend remains 469.72kB within its unchanged\\n+470kB error budget. The production Player-family gate and current publication CI\\n+remain separate checks; this fixes the rendering regression, not the full\\n+Original visual-parity matrix.\\n*** Update File: /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/ORIGINAL-UI-PARITY.md\\n@@\\n screenshots show the adapted Rewrite surface, not an equal-fixture comparison\\n against a rendered Original; the matrix rows remain open.\\n+The official ABI development-rendering regression is also fixed: Player loading\\n+notifications no longer synchronously change the parent save/leave state inside\\n+Angular's view/input lifecycle. The new isolated `smoke:ui:verona-development`\\n+gate passed both layouts with actual ABI input/save, authored reload, page\\n+reload and Unit changes, the same run and exact saved response, no page/console\\n+errors and final exit 0. This adds a dedicated CI check without disabling\\n+Angular verification or replacing another runtime's frontend/database. It is\\n+functional browser evidence, not matching-reference screenshot acceptance.\\n*** Update File: /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/README.md\\n@@\\n ## Integration Test Matrix\\n+\\n+`npm run smoke:ui:verona-development` separately checks the official ABI Player\\n+under Angular's development-mode rendering guards, in both interfaces. It builds\\n+into a fresh temporary directory and uses its own protected SQLite database;\\n+the shared production frontend and any caller-supplied database are untouched.\\n+It covers actual Player input/save, authored/page reload and Unit changes with\\n+same-run response restoration. `UI_SMOKE_HEADFUL=true` opens the test browser.\\n+CI runs it independently from the production-build Player smoke.\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rg 'ui_smoke_step=' /tmp/testcenter-verona-lifecycle-production-gate.log | tail -5 && git diff --check && git diff --stat && GODEBUG=http2client=0 gh run view 37147485772 --json status,conclusion,jobs --jq '{status,conclusion,unfinished:[.jobs[]|select(.status!=\\\"completed\\\")|{name,status}],failed:[.jobs[]|select(.status==\\\"completed\\\" and .conclusion!=\\\"success\\\")|{name,conclusion}]}'\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app\",\"max_output_tokens\":2500}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a10167-18c0-7481-a114-505958d1a634","create_time":1791055951.343517}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-03T19:33:22.571Z","ordinal":69256,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a","turn_id":"01a10167-18c0-7481-a114-505958d1a634","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-be271a41-8e14-4065-9a93-d5a7c7790b32","changes":{"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/README.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -869,2 +869,10 @@\n \n+`npm run smoke:ui:verona-development` separately checks the official ABI Player\n+under Angular's development-mode rendering guards, in both interfaces. It builds\n+into a fresh temporary directory and uses its own protected SQLite database;\n+the shared production frontend and any caller-supplied database are untouched.\n+It covers actual Player input/save, authored/page reload and Unit changes with\n+same-run response restoration. `UI_SMOKE_HEADFUL=true` opens the test browser.\n+CI runs it independently from the production-build Player smoke.\n+\n The production slice now has a small store matrix:\n","move_path":null},"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -207,5 +207,18 @@\n An additional development-build run exposed `NG0100` in the Participant view\n-while opening the official ABI Player family. It is an open rendering\n-regression, not an accepted visual-parity state. Production-build browser\n-verification is kept separate from this development-build finding.\n+while opening the official ABI Player family. A fresh headful reproduction\n+identified the synchronous Player `LOADING` log/save notification during\n+`ngAfterViewInit`/input changes: it changed the parent's already-checked\n+`canClearSession` binding. Logging and missing-input error notification now run\n+in the existing cancellable frame callback before iframe loading, outside that\n+render/verification pass. No Angular guard or global error reporting is disabled.\n+The new `smoke:ui:verona-development` gate builds into an owned temporary\n+directory and uses a fresh protected SQLite database. Its headful run passed\n+both Rewrite and Original layouts, real official ABI text/choice input, durable\n+save, authored reload, page reload and forward/back Unit changes, with the same\n+run and byte-identical saved response, no page/console errors and final exit 0.\n+It is registered as an independent CI matrix job. All 140 unit and 25 frontend\n+state tests passed; the production frontend remains 469.72kB within its unchanged\n+470kB error budget. The production Player-family gate and current publication CI\n+remain separate checks; this fixes the rendering regression, not the full\n+Original visual-parity matrix.\n \n","move_path":null},"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/ORIGINAL-UI-PARITY.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -134,2 +134,10 @@\n against a rendered Original; the matrix rows remain open.\n+The official ABI development-rendering regression is also fixed: Player loading\n+notifications no longer synchronously change the parent save/leave state inside\n+Angular's view/input lifecycle. The new isolated `smoke:ui:verona-development`\n+gate passed both layouts with actual ABI input/save, authored reload, page\n+reload and Unit changes, the same run and exact saved response, no page/console\n+errors and final exit 0. This adds a dedicated CI check without disabling\n+Angular verification or replacing another runtime's frontend/database. It is\n+functional browser evidence, not matching-reference screenshot acceptance.\n An additional headful check passed authored Unit/Booklet header titles,\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md\nM /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/ORIGINAL-UI-PARITY.md\nM /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/README.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1791056002568,"completed_at_ms":1791056002